SUMMARY:Lancaster Rec Presents: Lancaster Beer Gardens
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Rec’s traveling beer gardens transform the green space in Lancaster City parks into a community hub for networking\, entertainment\, and yard games.\n\nLocal brews and bites greet friends and families in a fenced in area as they re-imagine our parks as a place to meet\, eat\, play\, and enjoy some leisure time together. Food trucks rotate and offer a variety of different options from around the world to pair with your favorite local beverages\, with non-alcoholic options available.\n\nAt the end of the season\, proceeds are donated to Lancaster Rec to benefit our recreation programs. For more information and additional dates and locations\, please visit: www.LancasterRec.org/BeerGardens\n\n*Alcoholic beverages are only available to those 21 years and older. Please drink responsibly. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lancaster-rec-presents-lancaster-beer-gardens/2026-05-28/
LOCATION:Musser Park\, 135 N Lime Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/05/Musser-Park-Banner.avif
END:VEVENT
