SUMMARY:50th Anniversary Red Rose Run
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a milestone event—the 50th Annual Red Rose Run! We’re taking it back to 1977 to celebrate a 50-year tradition that has brought tens of thousands of runners\, walkers\, and community members to the heart of Downtown Lancaster.\n\nDress in your finest 1970’s running gear and be ready to bolt and boogie! Yes\, the best overall 1970’s themed costumed registrant will take home a City of Lancaster Prize Pack! Plus\, we’re going bigger than ever with over $27\,000 in prize money and a NEW $1\,977 prize for the runner who can break our course record.\n\nThe race takes participants on a scenic tour through Lancaster City and County Park\, featuring our signature mix of urban streets and rolling park hills. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/50th-anniversary-red-rose-run/
LOCATION:Binns Park\, 120 North Queen Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
ORGANIZER;CN="City of Lancaster":MAILTO:info@cityoflancasterpa.gov
END:VEVENT
