SUMMARY:Lancaster Home Event
DESCRIPTION:Thinking about buying\, selling\, investing\, or just curious what’s happening in the Lancaster market right now? This event is for YOU.\nJoin us at the Lancaster Home Event for a fun\, informative day filled with local real estate experts\, lenders\, home services\, vendors\, giveaways\, and valuable resources all in one place. Whether you’re a first time buyer\, planning your next move\, downsizing\, upsizing\, or simply want to learn more about homeownership and the local market\, there’s something here for everyone.\n✨ Meet trusted local professionals\n✨ Learn about today’s market trends\n✨ Get tips for buying\, selling\, financing & investing\n✨ Explore home improvement and lifestyle vendors\n✨ Family friendly atmosphere with giveaways and more\nThis is not your typical “salesy” event. It’s designed to educate\, connect\, and help our community feel more confident about their next steps.\n🎟️ RSVP here: www.lancasterhomeevent.com \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lancaster-home-event/
LOCATION:Guild Mortgage\, 1693 Crown Ave\, Lancaster\,\, PA\, 17601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/05/Untitled-design1-scaled.avif
END:VEVENT
